## Quick Reference

| Method | Use Case |
|--------|----------|
| `fetch` | Modern browsers, clean async/await |
| `XMLHttpRequest` | Legacy support needed |
| `FormData` | File uploads, form submissions |
| `JSON.stringify` | Sending JSON payload |
| `PartialView` | Dynamic HTML injection |

