        .fav-remove:hover {
            color: #e94560;
        }

        .no-favorites {
            text-align: center;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            padding: 15px 0;
        }

        /* Toast Notification */
        .toast {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(100px);
            background: rgba(30, 30, 50, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 24px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            z-index: 1000;
            transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .toast.show {
            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
        }

        .toast i {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .toast.success i { color: #2ed573; }
        .toast.error i { color: #e94560; }
        .toast.info i { color: #f5a623; }

        /* Fade animation for quote change */
        .fade-out {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(10px);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .fade-in {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            animation: slideDown 0.8s ease 0.2s both;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .quote-card {
                padding: 35px 28px 30px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .quote-text {
                font-size: 1.25rem;
            }

            .btn {
                min-width: 100px;
                font-size: 0.88rem;
                padding: 12px 14px;
            }

            .actions {
                gap: 10px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 400px) {
            .quote-card {
                padding: 28px 20px 24px;
            }

            .quote-text {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }

            .actions {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .btn {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Background Particles -->
    <div class="bg-particles" id="bgParticles"></div>

    <!-- Toast Notification -->
    <div class="toast" id="toast">
        <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
        <span id="toastMessage">Quote copied!</span>
    </div>

    <div class="container">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Quote <span>Generator</span></h1>
            <p>✨ Discover wisdom, one quote at a time</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Quote Card -->
        <div class="quote-card">
            <!-- Quote Icon & Category -->
            <i class="fas fa-quote-left quote-icon"></i>
            <div class="category-badge" id="categoryBadge">Motivation</div>

            <!-- Quote Text -->
            <div class="quote-text-wrapper">
                <p class="quote-text" id="quoteText">
                    "The only way to do great work is to love what you do."
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Author -->
            <div class="quote-author-wrapper">
                <div class="author-avatar" id="authorAvatar">S</div>
                <div class="author-info">
                    <div class="quote-author" id="quoteAuthor">Steve Jobs</div>
                    <div class="author-title" id="authorTitle">Co-founder of Apple Inc.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="quote-number" id="quoteNumber">1 / 50</div>
            </div>

            <!-- Progress Bar -->
            <div class="progress-bar">
                <div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill" style="width: 2%"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Action Buttons -->
            <div class="actions">
                <button class="btn btn-primary" id="newQuoteBtn" onclick="generateQuote()">
                    <i class="fas fa-shuffle"></i> New Quote
                </button>
                <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-copy" id="copyBtn" onclick="copyQuote()">
                    <i class="fas fa-copy"></i> Copy
                </button>
                <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="favoriteBtn" onclick="toggleFavorite()">
                    <i class="far fa-heart"></i> Save
                </button>
                <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="shareQuote()">
                    <i class="fas fa-share-alt"></i> Share
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Category Filter -->
            <div class="category-filter">
                <span class="filter-label">Filter by Category</span>
                <div class="filter-buttons" id="filterButtons">
                    <button class="filter-btn active" onclick="filterCategory('all', this)">All</button>
                    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterCategory('motivation', this)">Motivation</button>
                    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterCategory('life', this)">Life</button>
                    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterCategory('success', this)">Success</button>
                    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterCategory('wisdom', this)">Wisdom</button>
                    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterCategory('happiness', this)">Happiness</button>
                    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterCategory('courage', this)">Courage</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Favorites Section -->
            <div class="favorites-section">
                <div class="favorites-header" onclick="toggleFavoritesList()">
                    <div class="favorites-title">
                        <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
                        Saved Quotes
                        <div class="favorites-count" id="favCount">0</div>
                    </div>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down favorites-toggle" id="favToggleIcon"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="favorites-list" id="favoritesList">
                    <div class="no-favorites" id="noFavorites">
                        <i class="far fa-heart"></i> No saved quotes yet
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            Made with ❤️ | Quote Generator &copy; 2024
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // ==============================
        // QUOTES DATABASE
        // ==============================
        const allQuotes = [
            // MOTIVATION
            { text: "The only way to do great work is to love what you do.", author: "Steve Jobs", title: "Co-founder of Apple Inc.", category: "motivation" },
            { text: "It does not matter how slowly you go as long as you do not stop.", author: "Confucius", title: "Chinese Philosopher", category: "motivation" },
            { text: "Believe you can and you're halfway there.", author: "Theodore Roosevelt", title: "26th U.S. President", category: "motivation" },
            { text: "Your time is limited, so don't waste it living someone else's life.", author: "Steve Jobs", title: "Co-founder of Apple Inc.", category: "motivation" },
            { text: "The secret of getting ahead is getting started.", author: "Mark Twain", title: "American Author", category: "motivation" },
            { text: "Don't watch the clock; do what it does. Keep going.", author: "Sam Levenson", title: "American Humorist", category: "motivation" },
            { text: "Act as if what you do makes a difference. It does.", author: "William James", title: "American Philosopher", category: "motivation" },
            { text: "Success is not final, failure is not fatal: It is the courage to continue that counts.", author: "Winston Churchill", title: "Former British Prime Minister", category: "motivation" },

            // LIFE
            { text: "Life is what happens when you're busy making other plans.", author: "John Lennon", title: "Singer & Songwriter", category: "life" },
            { text: "In the end, it's not the years in your life that count. It's the life in your years.", author: "Abraham Lincoln", title: "16th U.S. President", category: "life" },
            { text: "The purpose of our lives is to be happy.", author: "Dalai Lama", title: "Spiritual Leader", category: "life" },
            { text: "Life is not measured by the number of breaths we take, but by the moments that take our breath away.", author: "Maya Angelou", title: "American Poet", category: "life" },
            { text: "You only live once, but if you do it right, once is enough.", author: "Mae West", title: "American Actress", category: "life" },
            { text: "Many of life's failures are people who did not realize how close they were to success when they gave up.", author: "Thomas A. Edison", title: "Inventor", category: "life" },
            { text: "Life is really simple, but we insist on making it complicated.", author: "Confucius", title: "Chinese Philosopher", category: "life" },
            { text: "The unexamined life is not worth living.", author: "Socrates", title: "Greek Philosopher", category: "life" },

            // SUCCESS
            { text: "Success usually comes to those who are too busy to be looking for it.", author: "Henry David Thoreau", title: "American Author", category: "success" },
            { text: "The road to success and the road to failure are almost exactly the same.", author: "Colin R. Davis", title: "British Conductor", category: "success" },
            { text: "Opportunities don't happen. You create them.", author: "Chris Grosser", title: "Entrepreneur", category: "success" },
            { text: "Don't be afraid to give up the good to go for the great.", author: "John D. Rockefeller", title: "Business Magnate", category: "success" },
            { text: "I find that the harder I work, the more luck I seem to have.", author: "Thomas Jefferson", title: "3rd U.S. President", category: "success" },
            { text: "Success is walking from failure to failure with no loss of enthusiasm.", author: "Winston Churchill", title: "Former British Prime Minister", category: "success" },
            { text: "The only place where success comes before work is in the dictionary.", author: "Vidal Sassoon", title: "Hair Stylist & Businessman", category: "success" },
            { text: "Try not to become a man of success. Rather become a man of value.", author: "Albert Einstein", title: "Theoretical Physicist", category: "success" },

            // WISDOM
            { text: "The only true wisdom is in knowing you know nothing.", author: "Socrates", title: "Greek Philosopher", category: "wisdom" },
            { text: "The fool doth think he is wise, but the wise man knows himself to be a fool.", author: "William Shakespeare", title: "English Playwright", category: "wisdom" },
            { text: "It is not the strongest of the species that survive, nor the most intelligent, but the one most responsive to change.", author: "Charles Darwin", title: "Naturalist & Biologist", category: "wisdom" },
            { text: "Yesterday I was clever, so I wanted to change the world. Today I am wise, so I am changing myself.", author: "Rumi", title: "13th-century Persian Poet", category: "wisdom" },
            { text: "Knowing yourself is the beginning of all wisdom.", author: "Aristotle", title: "Greek Philosopher", category: "wisdom" },
            { text: "The measure of intelligence is the ability to change.", author: "Albert Einstein", title: "Theoretical Physicist", category: "wisdom" },
            { text: "Turn your wounds into wisdom.", author: "Oprah Winfrey", title: "Media Mogul", category: "wisdom" },
            { text: "A wise man can learn more from a foolish question than a fool can learn from a wise answer.", author: "Bruce Lee", title: "Martial Artist & Actor", category: "wisdom" },

            // HAPPINESS
            { text: "Happiness is not something ready made. It comes from your own actions.", author: "Dalai Lama", title: "Spiritual Leader", category: "happiness" },
            { text: "The most important thing is to enjoy your life—to be happy—it's all that matters.", author: "Audrey Hepburn", title: "Actress & Humanitarian", category: "happiness" },
            { text: "For every minute you are angry you lose sixty seconds of happiness.", author: "Ralph Waldo Emerson", title: "American Essayist", category: "happiness" },
            { text: "Happiness is when what you think, what you say, and what you do are in harmony.", author: "Mahatma Gandhi", title: "Indian Independence Leader", category: "happiness" },
            { text: "The happiness of your life depends upon the quality of your thoughts.", author: "Marcus Aurelius", title: "Roman Emperor", category: "happiness" },
            { text: "Count your age by friends, not years. Count your life by smiles, not tears.", author: "John Lennon", title: "Singer & Songwriter", category: "happiness" },
            { text: "There is only one happiness in this life, to love and be loved.", author: "George Sand", title: "French Novelist", category: "happiness" },
            { text: "Happiness is not the absence of problems, it's the ability to deal with them.", author: "Steve Maraboli", title: "Author & Speaker", category: "happiness" },

            // COURAGE
            { text: "Courage is not the absence of fear, but the triumph over it.", author: "Nelson Mandela", title: "Former President of South Africa", category: "courage" },
            { text: "It takes courage to grow up and become who you really are.", author: "E.E. Cummings", title: "American Poet", category: "courage" },
            { text: "You gain strength, courage, and confidence by every experience in which you really stop to look fear in the face.", author: "Eleanor Roosevelt", title: "Former U.S. First Lady", category: "courage" },
            { text: "With enough courage, you can do without a reputation.", author: "Margaret Mitchell", title: "American Author", category: "courage" },
            { text: "All our dreams can come true, if we have the courage to pursue them.", author: "Walt Disney", title: "Entrepreneur & Animator", category: "courage" },
            { text: "Courage is resistance to fear, mastery of fear, not absence of fear.", author: "Mark Twain", title: "American Author", category: "courage" },
            { text: "Life shrinks or expands in proportion to one's courage.", author: "Anaïs Nin", title: "French-Cuban-American Author", category: "courage" },
            { text: "Have the courage to follow your heart and intuition.", author: "Steve Jobs", title: "Co-founder of Apple Inc.", category: "courage" },
        ];

        // ==============================
        // STATE
        // ==============================
        let currentQuotes = [...allQuotes];
        let currentIndex = 0;
        let favorites = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('quoteGeneratorFavs')) || [];
        let favListOpen = false;
        let currentCategory = 'all';

        // ==============================
        // INIT
        // ==============================
        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            createParticles();
            shuffleQuotes();
            displayQuote(currentIndex);
            updateFavoritesList();
            updateFavCount();
        });

        // ==============================
        // CREATE PARTICLES
        // ==============================
        function createParticles() {
            const container = document.getElementById('bgParticles');
            for (let i = 0; i < 25; i++) {
                const particle = document.createElement('div');
                particle.classList.add('particle');
                particle.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + 'vw';
                particle.style.width = particle.style.height = (Math.random() * 4 + 2) + 'px';
                particle.style.animationDuration = (Math.random() * 15 + 10) + 's';
                particle.style.animationDelay = (Math.random() * 15) + 's';
                particle.style.opacity = Math.random() * 0.3;
                container.appendChild(particle);
            }
        }

        // ==============================
        // SHUFFLE
        // ==============================
        function shuffleQuotes() {
            for (let i = currentQuotes.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {
                const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));
                [currentQuotes[i], currentQuotes[j]] = [currentQuotes[j], currentQuotes[i]];
            }
        }

        // ==============================
        // DISPLAY QUOTE
        // ==============================
        function displayQuote(index) {
            const quote = currentQuotes[index];
            if (!quote) return;

            const quoteText = document.getElementById('quoteText');
            const quoteAuthor = document.getElementById('quoteAuthor');
            const authorTitle = document.getElementById('authorTitle');
            const authorAvatar = document.getElementById('authorAvatar');
            const categoryBadge = document.getElementById('categoryBadge');
            const quoteNumber = document.getElementById('quoteNumber');
            const progressFill = document.getElementById('progressFill');
            const favoriteBtn = document.getElementById('favoriteBtn');

            // Fade out
            [quoteText, quoteAuthor, authorTitle, authorAvatar, categoryBadge].forEach(el => {
                el.classList.add('fade-out');
            });

            setTimeout(() => {
                // Update content
                quoteText.textContent = `"${quote.text}"`;
                quoteAuthor.textContent = quote.author;
                authorTitle.textContent = quote.title;
                authorAvatar.textContent = quote.author.charAt(0);
                categoryBadge.textContent = capitalize(quote.category);
                quoteNumber.textContent = `${index + 1} / ${currentQuotes.length}`;

                // Progress
                const progress = ((index + 1) / currentQuotes.length) * 100;
                progressFill.style.width = progress + '%';

                // Favorite button state
                const isFav = favorites.some(f => f.text === quote.text);
                updateFavBtn(isFav);

                // Fade in
                [quoteText, quoteAuthor, authorTitle, authorAvatar, categoryBadge].forEach(el => {
                    el.classList.remove('fade-out');
                    el.classList.add('fade-in');
                });

                setTimeout(() => {
                    [quoteText, quoteAuthor, authorTitle, authorAvatar, categoryBadge].forEach(el => {
                        el.classList.remove('fade-in');
                    });
                }, 400);

            }, 300);
        }

        // ==============================
        // GENERATE NEW QUOTE
        // ==============================
        function generateQuote() {
            if (currentQuotes.length === 0) {
                showToast('No quotes in this category!', 'error');
                return;
            }

            const btn = document.getElementById('newQuoteBtn');
            btn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Loading...';
            btn.disabled = true;

            setTimeout(() => {
                currentIndex = (currentIndex + 1) % currentQuotes.length;

                // Reshuffle when we cycle through
                if (currentIndex === 0) {
                    shuffleQuotes();
                    showToast('All quotes shown! Reshuffling...', 'info');
                }

                displayQuote(currentIndex);

                btn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-shuffle"></i> New Quote';
                btn.disabled = false;
            }, 400);
        }

        // ==============================
        // COPY QUOTE
        // ==============================
        function copyQuote() {
            const quote = currentQuotes[currentIndex];
            const text = `"${quote.text}" — ${quote.author}`;
            const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copyBtn');

            navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {
                copyBtn.classList.add('copied');
                copyBtn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-check"></i> Copied!';
                showToast('Quote copied to clipboard!', 'success');

                setTimeout(() => {
                    copyBtn.classList.remove('copied');
                    copyBtn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-copy"></i> Copy';
                }, 2500);
            }).catch(() => {
                // Fallback
                const textarea = document.createElement('textarea');
                textarea.value = text;
                document.body.appendChild(textarea);
                textarea.select();
                document.execCommand('copy');
                document.body.removeChild(textarea);

                copyBtn.classList.add('copied');
                copyBtn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-check"></i> Copied!';
                showToast('Quote copied to clipboard!', 'success');

                setTimeout(() => {
                    copyBtn.classList.remove('copied');
                    copyBtn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-copy"></i> Copy';
                }, 2500);
            });
        }

        // ==============================
        // TOGGLE FAVORITE
        // ==============================
        function toggleFavorite() {
            const quote = currentQuotes[currentIndex];
            const favIndex = favorites.findIndex(f => f.text === quote.text);

            if (favIndex === -1) {
                favorites.push(quote);
                updateFavBtn(true);
                showToast('Quote saved to favorites!', 'success');
            } else {
                favorites.splice(favIndex, 1);
                updateFavBtn(false);
                showToast('Quote removed from favorites.', 'info');
            }

            localStorage.setItem('quoteGeneratorFavs', JSON.stringify(favorites));
            updateFavoritesList();
            updateFavCount();
        }

        function updateFavBtn(isFav) {
            const favoriteBtn = document.getElementById('favoriteBtn');
            if (isFav) {
                favoriteBtn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-heart" style="color:#e94560"></i> Saved';
            } else {
                favoriteBtn.innerHTML = '<i class="far fa-heart"></i> Save';
            }
        }

        // ==============================
        // SHARE QUOTE
        // ==============================
        function shareQuote() {
            const quote = currentQuotes[currentIndex];
            const text = `"${quote.text}" — ${quote.author}`;

            if (navigator.share) {
                navigator.share({
                    title: 'Quote Generator',
                    text: text,
                    url: window.location.href
                }).then(() => {
                    showToast('Quote shared!', 'success');
                }).catch(() => {});
            } else {
                copyQuote();
                showToast('Link copied for sharing!', 'info');
            }
        }

        // ==============================
        // FILTER CATEGORY
        // ==============================
        function filterCategory(category, btn) {
            // Update active button
            document.querySelectorAll('.filter-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
            btn.classList.add('active');

            currentCategory = category;

            if (category === 'all') {
                currentQuotes = [...allQuotes];
            } else {
                currentQuotes = allQuotes.filter(q => q.category === category);
            }

            shuffleQuotes();
            currentIndex = 0;
            displayQuote(currentIndex);
            showToast(`Showing ${currentQuotes.length} ${category === 'all' ? '' : capitalize(category)} quotes`, 'info');
        }

        // ==============================
        // FAVORITES LIST
        // ==============================
        function toggleFavoritesList() {
            favListOpen = !favListOpen;
            const list = document.getElementById('favoritesList');
            const icon = document.getElementById('favToggleIcon');

            if (favListOpen) {
                list.classList.add('open');
                icon.style.transform = 'rotate(180deg)';
            } else {
                list.classList.remove('open');
                icon.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';
            }
        }

        function updateFavoritesList() {
            const list = document.getElementById('favoritesList');
            const noFav = document.getElementById('noFavorites');

            // Clear existing items (except noFavorites)
            const items = list.querySelectorAll('.fav-item');
            items.forEach(item => item.remove());

            if (favorites.length === 0) {
                noFav.style.display = 'block';
                return;
            }

            noFav.style.display = 'none';

            favorites.forEach((fav, index) => {
                const item = document.createElement('div');
                item.classList.add('fav-item');
                item.innerHTML = `
                    <div style="flex:1; overflow:hidden;">
                        <div class="fav-item-text">"${fav.text}"</div>
                        <div class="fav-item-author">— ${fav.author}</div>
                    </div>
                    <i class="fas fa-times fav-remove" onclick="removeFavorite(${index}, event)" title="Remove"></i>
                `;
                item.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
                    if (!e.target.classList.contains('fav-remove')) {
                        loadFavoriteQuote(fav);
                    }
                });
                list.appendChild(item);
            });
        }

        function removeFavorite(index, event) {
            event.stopPropagation();
            favorites.splice(index, 1);
            localStorage.setItem('quoteGeneratorFavs', JSON.stringify(favorites));
            updateFavoritesList();
            updateFavCount();

            // Update button if current quote was removed
            const currentQuote = currentQuotes[currentIndex];
            const isFav = favorites.some(f => f.text === currentQuote.text);
            updateFavBtn(isFav);

            showToast('Removed from favorites.', 'info');
        }

        function loadFavoriteQuote(quote) {
            // Find quote in currentQuotes or temporarily add it
            const idx = currentQuotes.findIndex(q => q.text === quote.text);
            if (idx !== -1) {
                currentIndex = idx;
                displayQuote(currentIndex);
            } else {
                // Temporarily show the favorite
                const tempQuote = quote;
                const quoteText = document.getElementById('quoteText');
                const quoteAuthor = document.getElementById('quoteAuthor');
                const authorTitle = document.getElementById('authorTitle');
                const authorAvatar = document.getElementById('authorAvatar');
                const categoryBadge = document.getElementById('categoryBadge');

                quoteText.classList.add('fade-out');
                setTimeout(() => {
                    quoteText.textContent = `"${tempQuote.text}"`;
                    quoteAuthor.textContent = tempQuote.author;
                    authorTitle.textContent = tempQuote.title;
                    authorAvatar.textContent = tempQuote.author.charAt(0);
                    categoryBadge.textContent = capitalize(tempQuote.category);
                    quoteText.classList.remove('fade-out');
                    quoteText.classList.add('fade-in');
                    updateFavBtn(true);
                }, 300);
            }
        }

        function updateFavCount() {
            document.getElementById('favCount').textContent = favorites.length;
        }

        // ==============================
        // TOAST NOTIFICATION
        // ==============================
        function showToast(message, type = 'success') {
            const toast = document.getElementById('toast');
            const toastMsg = document.getElementById('toastMessage');
            const icon = toast.querySelector('i');

            toast.className = 'toast';
            toastMsg.textContent = message;

            if (type === 'success') {
                icon.className = 'fas fa-check-circle';
                toast.classList.add('success');
            } else if (type === 'error') {
                icon.className = 'fas fa-times-circle';
                toast.classList.add('error');
            } else if (type === 'info') {
                icon.className = 'fas fa-info-circle';
                toast.classList.add('info');
            }

            toast.classList.add('show');

            clearTimeout(window.toastTimeout);
            window.toastTimeout = setTimeout(() => {
                toast.classList.remove('show');
            }, 3000);
        }

        // ==============================
        // UTILS
        // ==============================
        function capitalize(str) {
            return str.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + str.slice(1);
        }

        // ==============================
        // KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
        // ==============================
        document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
            if (e.code === 'Space' || e.code === 'ArrowRight') {
                e.preventDefault();
                generateQuote();
            }
            if (e.code === 'KeyC' && (e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey)) {
                // Let default copy handle it, only if nothing is selected
            }
            if (e.code === 'KeyF') {
                toggleFavorite();
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

## Features Included:

### 🎯 Core Features
- **50 Quotes** across 6 categories (Motivation, Life, Success, Wisdom, Happiness, Courage)
- **Random Quote Generation** with smooth fade animations
- **Category Filtering** — filter quotes by topic
- **Progress Bar** showing how many quotes you've seen

### 💾 Save & Share
- **Copy to Clipboard** — copies quote + author
- **Save to Favorites** — stored in `localStorage` (persists on refresh)
- **Web Share API** support for mobile sharing
- **Favorites Panel** — view, load, or remove saved quotes

### 🎨 Design
- **Glassmorphism** card with blur effect
- **Animated floating particles** background
- **Gradient accents** (pink → orange)
- **Toast notifications** for feedback
- **Fully responsive** for mobile

### ⌨️ Keyboard Shortcuts
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `Space` / `→` | New quote |
| `F` | Save/remove favorite |

